OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with some bright
OL,7,Fspells at first. Outbreaks of
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain in the west
OL,9,Fovernight, staying mostly dry in the
OL,10,Feast. Freshening southerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy rain in the morning then dry for
OL,14,Fa time before further showers in the
OL,15,Fafternoon and evening. Fresh to strong
OL,16,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
